{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "d90fce69808e4fa2be95d383252e1da7a7d1d790572c463696602c3908bd8bf7", "ja": "あれ、{$P$}さん？\nお疲れさまです。お茶休憩ですか？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生？\n您辛苦了。是要喝杯茶休息一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1001_p", "source_sha256": "abda21b8f8ce8b061af23efc3db77ae033595d5c6f30e1f692f4c37f88554f23", "ja": "そうだよ。ちょっと喉が渇いてね。\n美奈子もか？", "zh": "是啊，刚好有点口渴。\n美奈子也来喝茶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "0b458201c9398619a70a7d8775c26ee31501e812d3547d67532af5d2059fe6b5", "ja": "私はお茶を点てようと思って来たんです。美味しい\n抹茶が手に入ったから、みんなに飲んで欲しいなって。", "zh": "我是来沏茶的。因为弄到了很美味的抹茶，就想着让大家也喝喝看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2ee84e8c7e24e2a282dac8a148aa6ce15e87f4de5598ecbf754f4714b64257e3", "ja": "へえ、抹茶か。そういえばこの間、\n京都の有名な家元で茶道を教わったんだったな。", "zh": "哦，抹茶啊。说起来，前段时间你还在京都有名的家元那里学过茶道来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "a7f9d1255307d028939c61115251a141aa6a48ca3e053eb82ce42e65c7c59f15", "ja": "はいっ！　……そうだ、{$P$}さん！\n勉強の成果、見てくれませんか？", "zh": "好！……对了，{$P$}先生！\n能看看我的学习成果吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3ba58029ce4b0909bfaf174f687124002b79eca5395c87933b4c5cdd527c1e21", "ja": "ああ、構わないよ。ただ、作法とか詳しくないんだけど\n……それでも大丈夫か？", "zh": "啊，没问题。不过，我对礼仪之类的不太了解……这样也可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "5c1a671445b2742a29b1c872e983ea1bd03d76c232420c2a77abb4ab522dec93", "ja": "もちろんです！　難しいことは考えないでください。\n心地いい時間を過ごすことが、一番大事ですから！", "zh": "当然可以！请不要去想那些复杂的事情。因为度过一段舒适愉快的时光，才是最重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1007_p", "source_sha256": "76b4ee383d05f6374f2b003203e1c7151e148f11805da73e91bdeff558a3b909", "ja": "そうなんだな。この機会に教えてもらおうかな。\nよろしくな、美奈子。いや、美奈子先生！", "zh": "原来如此。那就趁这个机会请你教教我吧。\n拜托你了，美奈子。不，美奈子老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "92c2f92a2f4e4f338ac2844384b3e5537dda438dd84383361983b517d207139c", "ja": "ふふっ、はい！　茶道の知識も、それからお腹も！\n両方とも、い～っぱい満たしてあげますね♪", "zh": "呵呵，好的！无论是茶道知识，还是肚子！\n我都会把这两样都填得满满的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0402_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0402_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a35abc3822f35d99b258124cea2326fa378102c0d4e71fb435f8de35fee81ef9", "ja": "（あれ？　机の上にある大量の和菓子は……。\nきっと、みんなで分けるんだよな……そうだよな？）", "zh": "（咦？桌上这些大量的日式点心……\n肯定是要大家一起分着吃的吧……应该是吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
